      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每张牌可直接发动效果，也可转化为Political Capital释放个人Tactic",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Every card is a choice – you can either play it for the effect (how conventional!) or you can do as any good politician does and seek to exploit it for Political Capital, which allows you to deploy your powerful personal Tactics.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3214480/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "执政需同时维持个人权威、政治资本、民调和现金，公众、党内与对手诉求互相冲突",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The public wants things you can't afford, your party wants things you can't achieve and opponents just want you dead. To hold on to power you'll have to somehow maintain your personal authority, political capital, poll rating and cash.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3214480/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
